-; Application - WELD NUT 3 (PN3) AT THE CENTERLINE PEDESTAL
-;********************************
-; CALLED BY Style1Opt1. APPROACH THE PEDESTAL (BASE 3 "NUT WELDER"), WAIT FOR THE NUT PRELOAD
